+
+### Documentation (this feature)
+
+```text
+specs/001-order-refund/
+├── plan.md              # This file (/speckit-plan command output)
+├── spec.md              # Feature spec
+├── research.md          # Phase 0 output
+├── data-model.md        # Phase 1 output
